<title>FINLAND: Finnish Q4 GDP up 5.8 pct yr/yr, up 1.3 pct on Q3.</title>
<headline>Finnish Q4 GDP up 5.8 pct yr/yr, up 1.3 pct on Q3.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's gross domestic product (GDP) at market prices rose 5.8 percent year-on-year in the fourth quarter of 1996, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>SF revised full-year 1996 GDP growth to 3.3 percent.</p>
<p>Adjusted for seasonal factors, Q4 GDP grew 1.3 percent on Q3, SF said.</p>
<p>			 Q4 '96	Q3 '96	Q4 '95</p>
<p>Quarter/Quarter     +1.3	  +2.4	  +2.4</p>
<p>Year/Year	     +5.8	  +4.1	  +4.5</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
